<title>USA: Envirometrics says ends merger talks.</title>
<headline>Envirometrics says ends merger talks.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLESTON, S.C. 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Envirometrics Inc said Friday that merger discussions with Employee Resource Management Inc ended.</p>
<p>Envirometrics said it does not believe the merger will occur and as a result it believes it will be delisted by Nasdaq effective November 25 for failure to comply with the market's net capital requirements.</p>
</text>
